    {
      "id": "claim_1a3bb36325df453fae9fada7a028309d",
      "statement": "`SecurityValuationRepository` is wired into dependency injection by `sqlalchemy_security_valuation_repository_factory`, registered against the ABC key in `register_market_services` (`src/market/__init__.py`), which is how the router resolves it with `services.aget(SecurityValuationRepository)`.",
