    {
      "id": "claim_b52d07b2eb794b72b382d8bffc07c157",
      "statement": "`FundamentalsGroup` is the editing surface on the security detail page: it fetches the range via `valuationClient.getValuation(securityId)` inside an untracked `$effect` gated on `expanded && securityId`, treats `null` as the \"Fair value range not set.\" empty state (a genuine error instead renders `SidebarError` with a retry), and passes the range into `ValuationModal` whose `onSaved` writes the returned row straight back into the two-way-bound `valuation` (and thus the chart) without a refetch.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://frontend/src/lib/components/actions-sidebar/fundamentals/fundamentals-group.svelte#L104-L149",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f9099127e6f380b167ad664659fdb43079ae1faad9b653151de6dafdcce72002:"
