    {
      "id": "claim_daf8493d09d346ca8814772f399a4216",
      "statement": "`ValuationModal` is the only validation point for a range: it rejects a null or non-positive lower/upper bound and a `lowerBound > upperBound` pair with an inline message before calling `valuationClient.setValuation`, and on success invokes `onSaved` and closes the modal, so the client is never called with an inverted range.",
