    {
      "id": "claim_eea0c8438d4d45d79e90d6e24100deb1",
      "statement": "`ValuationBandPrimitive` renders the range as a single bottom-z-ordered pane on the main series: `ValuationBandPaneView.zOrder()` returns `'bottom'`, and `ValuationBandRenderer.draw` returns without drawing when `visible` is false, either bound is null, or no series is attached, otherwise converting both prices with `series.priceToCoordinate()` and filling the rectangle between them with a translucent blue plus dashed stroke lines at each bound inside `useBitmapCoordinateSpace`.",
