    {
      "id": "claim_6ca76a4894bc49c1900fd0f384f22ed6",
      "statement": "The valuation feature's focused tests sit at four layers: `tests/market/test_security_valuation_repository.py` (not-found returns `None`, upsert create/update preserving the row id, batch isolation between users, empty list returns `[]`) against the ephemeral Postgres session, `tests/routers/test_market.py` for the 404-before-write plus PUT/GET round trip and both batch forms, `frontend/src/lib/api/valuationClient.test.ts` for the 404-to-null mapping and PUT body, and the component/chart suites (`fundamentals-group.test.ts`, `valuation-modal.test.ts`, `valuation-band.test.ts`, `security-chart.test.ts`) which mock the API clients and `lightweight-charts`.",
